**Proposer:** Ganesha (Claude Code)
**Date:** 2026-02-26T00:00:00Z
**Type:** Feature
**Trust Level:** ENGINEER (3)

## Summary
Add five newly scaffolded apps to the community_apps section of SAFE/apps/REGISTRY.yaml:
law-gazelle, public-ledger, private-ledger, field-notes, source-trail.
Also updates last_updated date to 2026-02-26. All repos are live on GitHub.

## Risk Assessment
- **Risk Level:** MINIMAL
- **Reversible:** YES — remove the five entries from community_apps
- **Dependencies:** All five GitHub repos exist and are public
- **Testing:** Verify REGISTRY.yaml parses as valid YAML after apply

## ΔE Impact
Expected ΔE: +0.02 (additive registry entries only)

## Implementation

```python
from pathlib import Path

f = Path(r"C:/Users/Sean/Documents/GitHub/SAFE/apps/REGISTRY.yaml")
content = f.read_text(encoding="utf-8")

OLD = 'last_updated: "2026-02-21"'
NEW = 'last_updated: "2026-02-26"'
content = content.replace(OLD, NEW, 1)

OLD2 = "community_apps: []"
NEW2 = """community_apps:
  - app_id: law-gazelle
    name: Law Gazelle
    repository: https://github.com/rudi193-cmd/safe-app-law-gazelle
    author: Sean Campbell
    status: seed
    privacy_tier: client_only
    local_processing: 0.96
    description: Legal reference tool — statute search, case summaries, plain-language explainers from verified sources.
    tags:
      - legal
      - reference
      - verified-sources

  - app_id: public-ledger
    name: Public Ledger
    repository: https://github.com/rudi193-cmd/safe-app-public-ledger
    author: Sean Campbell
    status: seed
    privacy_tier: client_only
    local_processing: 0.80
    description: Public records financial auditor — search government budgets and IRS Form 990 filings for nonprofits.
    tags:
      - finance
      - public-records
      - government
      - nonprofit
      - transparency

  - app_id: private-ledger
    name: Private Ledger
    repository: https://github.com/rudi193-cmd/safe-app-private-ledger
    author: Sean Campbell
    status: seed
    privacy_tier: client_only
    local_processing: 1.0
    description: Local personal budgeting companion — fully private, no cloud sync. Paired with Public Ledger.
    tags:
      - finance
      - budgeting
      - privacy
      - local-only

  - app_id: field-notes
    name: Field Notes
    repository: https://github.com/rudi193-cmd/safe-app-field-notes
    author: Sean Campbell
    status: seed
    privacy_tier: client_only
    local_processing: 0.96
    description: Quick-capture notebook for observations, ideas, and research notes. Feeds into The Binder.
    tags:
      - notes
      - capture
      - research
      - binder

  - app_id: source-trail
    name: Source Trail
    repository: https://github.com/rudi193-cmd/safe-app-source-trail
    author: Sean Campbell
    status: seed
    privacy_tier: client_only
    local_processing: 0.90
    description: Citation and source tracker — log, verify, and link your research sources. AskJeles companion.
    tags:
      - citations
      - research
      - sources
      - jeles"""
content = content.replace(OLD2, NEW2, 1)

f.write_text(content, encoding="utf-8")
print("Done.")
```

